      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hard-16-9-wide",
      "summary": "Sixteen pinned Hard matches on the training map: four seeds for every faction matchup.",
      "$comment": [
        "Seeds became worth multiplying once the engine stopped seeding the opponent AI from the",
        "wall clock. Before that, every bot module drew from World.LocalRandom, which was",
        "constructed with no seed, so a pinned lobby seed reproduced the map and nothing that the",
        "opponent did - the same revision on seed 300002 scored anywhere from 0.108 to 1.000.",
        "A seed now names a reproducible opponent, so a wider set buys scenario coverage rather",
        "than repeat sampling of one noisy draw."
      ],
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "maxGameSeconds": 2400,
      "matches": [
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 300001 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 300002 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 310001 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 310002 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 300003 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 300004 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 310003 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 310004 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 300005 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 300006 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 310005 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 310006 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 300007 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 300008 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 310007 },
        { "map": "16-9.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 310008 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hard-holdout",
      "summary": "Twelve pinned Hard matches on three maps the training set never uses. Never train on this.",
      "$comment": [
        "A promotion set is something a change can be fitted to: a deterministic benchmark is a",
        "fixed list of games, and a change that only suits those games will pass it. This set",
        "exists to be the thing that was not optimised against, so a promoted change can be asked",
        "whether it generalised. Keep its maps and seeds disjoint from every other set, and do not",
        "promote on it - read it."
      ],
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "maxGameSeconds": 2400,
      "matches": [
        { "map": "chokepoint.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 400001 },
        { "map": "chokepoint.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 400002 },
        { "map": "chokepoint.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 400003 },
        { "map": "chokepoint.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 400004 },
        { "map": "blue-mountains.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 400005 },
        { "map": "blue-mountains.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 400006 },
        { "map": "blue-mountains.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 400007 },
        { "map": "blue-mountains.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 400008 },
        { "map": "carters-ridge.oramap", "faction": "gdi", "botFaction": "nod", "seed": 400009 },
        { "map": "carters-ridge.oramap", "faction": "nod", "botFaction": "gdi", "seed": 400010 },
